    {
      "name": "@kadaliao/dsh-bots",
      "title": {
        "en": "Bots",
        "zh": "Bots"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Grok-style bot teams for one-person companies and role-split work: hire a ready-made team (one-person company, software squad, content studio, research desk) in one click, each bot with its own persona, avatar, model, skills, abilities, apps and scheduled tasks, and its own memory, summarized after every task and consolidated nightly with the team's. Bots message each other and a dispatcher hands out the work. Built on Harness: reuse your installed skills, import skills from GitHub or a local folder or let a bot write its own, and import MCP servers from Codex, Claude Code or Cursor. Run a bot on your own endpoint or the Codex CLI's ChatGPT login; conversations start a new topic before they grow too big; a usage view counts tokens and cost by bot, task and day. Message the team from Feishu / Lark, Telegram, Slack or Discord and get the reports back in the chat.",
        "zh": "把 Grok bot 搬进 DeepSeek Harness：给一人公司和分工协作场景的 bot 团队。一键雇用现成团队（一人公司、研发小队、内容工作室、研究台），每个 bot 有自己的人设、头像、模型、技能、能力、应用和定时任务，还有自己的记忆：每个任务后自动总结，每晚和团队共享记忆一起整理；bot 之间私信协作，调度员负责分派。充分复用 Harness：直接用已装的技能、从 GitHub 或本地文件夹导入、或让 bot 自己写技能，从 Codex、Claude Code、Cursor 导入 MCP 服务。bot 可以用自定义端点或 Codex CLI 的 ChatGPT 登录；对话太长前自动开新话题；用量页按 bot、任务、日期统计 tokens 和费用。在飞书、Telegram、Slack 或 Discord 里就能给团队派活，汇报回到聊天里。"
      },
      "icon": "./plugins/bots/icon.svg",
      "author": "kadaliao",
